">Eldage</a></li></ul></div></div></details><details><summary>About</summary><div class=\"drawer-group\"><a class=\"overview-link\" href=\"/en/about\">About FIMMICK<!-- --> →</a><div><h3>Company</h3><ul><li><a href=\"/en/about/our-story\">Our story</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/about/how-we-work\">How we work</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/about/why-fimmick\">Why FIMMICK</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/about/team\">Leadership</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/about/asia-delivery\">Regional delivery</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/contact\">Contact &amp; offices</a></li></ul></div></div></details><div class=\"drawer-actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--accent\" href=\"/en/contact?intent=demo\">Request a demo</a><a class=\"btn btn--ghost\" href=\"https://aip.fimmick.com/\" rel=\"noopener\">AIP login</a><span class=\"lang-switch\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Language\"><span aria-current=\"true\" lang=\"en\" title=\"English\">EN<span class=\"sr-only\"> <!-- -->English</span></span><a href=\"/zh-hant/resources/videos\" hrefLang=\"zh-Hant-HK\" lang=\"zh-Hant-HK\" title=\"繁體中文\">繁<span class=\"sr-only\"> <!-- -->繁體中文</span></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/resources/videos\" hrefLang=\"zh-Hans\" lang=\"zh-Hans\" title=\"简体中文\">简<span class=\"sr-only\"> <!-- -->简体中文</span></a></span></div></nav></div><main id=\"main\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"VideoObject\",\"name\":\"From brief to reviewed output: a FIMMICK AIP workflow\",\"description\":\"A 42-second product demonstration using the same sample data as the interactive examples: brand facts, a prepared draft, a reviewer’s decision, an export and its record.\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://www.fimmick.com/media/explainer/poster-title.webp\",\"uploadDate\":\"2026-09-28\",\"duration\":\"PT42S\",\"contentUrl\":\"https://www.fimmick.com/media/explainer/fimmick-aip-explainer-en.mp4\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\"}</script><section class=\"page-hero\"><div class=\"container\"><nav class=\"breadcrumbs\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><ol><li><a href=\"/en\">Home</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/resources\">Resources</a></li><li aria-current=\"page\">Videos &amp; demos</li></ol></nav><div class=\"page-hero-grid\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Resources</p><h1><span>Videos &amp; demos</span></h1><p class=\"lead\">A short product demonstration with captions and a full transcript. The film uses the same sample data as the interactive examples.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"container detail-grid\"><div class=\"stack\"><div class=\"player\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1280 / 720\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"player__poster\"><img src=\"/media/explainer/poster-title.webp\" srcSet=\"/media/explainer/poster-title-640.webp 640w, /media/explainer/poster-title.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1000px) 760px, 100vw\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/><span class=\"player__play\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\"><path d=\"M8 5.5v13l11-6.5z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"player__meta\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Play video<!-- -->: </span>From brief to reviewed output: a FIMMICK AIP workflow<!-- --> · <!-- -->42<!-- -->s · <!-- -->captions</span></button></div><h2>From brief to reviewed output: a FIMMICK AIP workflow</h2><p class=\"muted\">A 42-second product demonstration using the same sample data as the interactive examples: brand facts, a prepared draft, a reviewer’s decision, an export and its record.</p><p class=\"notice\">Illustrative workflow — sample data. Rendered from the website’s sample interface; no live AI run, message or system update is shown.</p><p class=\"micro muted\">28 Sept 2026<!-- --> · <!-- -->42<!-- -->s · <!-- -->No audio track. Captions: English, Traditional Chinese.</p></div><aside class=\"detail-aside\"><div class=\"transcript\" id=\"transcript\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.2rem;margin-bottom:16px\">Transcript</h2><ol><li><time>0:00</time><p><strong>One business job</strong><br/>Start with one business job: launch content for a new product.</p></li><li><time>0:05</time><p><strong>Your business context</strong><br/>Approved brand facts enter the workspace: 750 ml, double-wall steel, three colours — and no price supplied.</p></li><li><time>0:12</time><p><strong>The work, prepared</strong><br/>Drafts are prepared from those facts in English and Traditional Chinese, with each fact shown beside the draft.</p></li><li><time>0:22</time><p><strong>People decide</strong><br/>A brand manager softens the tone and approves the caption, and returns a visual with the wrong colour name.</p></li><li><time>0:30</time><p><strong>A usable, traceable result</strong><br/>The approved content is exported with its sources, review notes and a record for next time.</p></li><li><time>0:37</time><p><strong>FIMMICK AIP</strong><br/>FIMMICK AIP — Agentic AI Platform. Choose one workflow and discuss a starting scope.</p></li></ol></div><a class=\"btn btn--ghost\" href=\"/en/platform\">Read the platform story<!-- --> →</a></aside></div></section><section class=\"section section--tight\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"cta-band\"><div class=\"stack\"><h2>See the workflow with your own content</h2></div><div class=\"btn-row\"><a class=\"btn btn--accent\" href=\"/en/contact?intent=demo&amp;resource=fimmick-aip-explainer\">Request a demo<!-- --> <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></div></main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"footer-cta\"><p class=\"footer-cta__title\">Have a workflow <em class=\"accent\">in mind?</em></p><div class=\"footer-cta__actions\"><a class=\"footer-cta__mail\" href=\"mailto:business@fimmick.com\">business@fimmick.com</a><a class=\"btn btn--accent\" href=\"/en/contact?intent=demo\">Request a demo<!-- --> <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div></div><div class=\"footer-top\"><di